### Component: Policy Firewall & Tool Stripping

#### [NEW] [`depth_firewall.py`](file:///c:/Users/<you>/Documents/Code/agent-skills/skills/unattended-orchestration/mcp/policy/depth_firewall.py)
- Validates delegation depth on every spawn request:
  - Depth 1 (Root Orchestrator): May spawn depth 2 sessions.
  - Depth 2 (Phase Orchestrator): May spawn depth 3 sessions.
  - Depth 3 (Task Worker): Rejects spawn calls with `DelegationDepthExceededError`.
- Computes `--disallowedTools` or `--no-subagents` flags and strips `Agent` / `Workflow` / `unattended_orchestration_*` tools for leaf subagents.

