### Component: Queryable MCP Resources

#### [NEW] [`sessions.py`](file:///c:/Users/<you>/Documents/Code/agent-skills/skills/unattended-orchestration/mcp/resources/sessions.py)
- Exposes `handoff://sessions`:
  - Returns structured list of sessions: ID, status (`running`, `waiting`, `merged`, `blocked`, `crashed`), model, turn count, elapsed time.
- Exposes `handoff://sessions/{id}`:
  - Detailed view including branch name, worktree path, attached PID, active task, and exit code.

#### [NEW] [`tree.py`](file:///c:/Users/<you>/Documents/Code/agent-skills/skills/unattended-orchestration/mcp/resources/tree.py)
- Exposes `handoff://subagents/tree`:
  - Renders hierarchical JSON and clean ASCII tree depicting the 3-level topology:
    - Root Orchestrator $\rightarrow$ Phase Subagents $\rightarrow$ Leaf Task Workers with live statuses.

#### [NEW] [`diff.py`](file:///c:/Users/<you>/Documents/Code/agent-skills/skills/unattended-orchestration/mcp/resources/diff.py)
- Exposes `handoff://sessions/{id}/diff`:
  - Runs `git diff <base>...<branch>` against the session worktree, allowing interactive agents to review code changes without reading files one by one.

#### [NEW] [`ledger.py`](file:///c:/Users/<you>/Documents/Code/agent-skills/skills/unattended-orchestration/mcp/resources/ledger.py)
- Exposes `handoff://ledger`:
  - Streams recent sanitized events from `.handoff/progress.jsonl` with automatic secret redaction.

