### Component: Execution Tools

#### [NEW] [`spawn.py`](file:///c:/Users/<you>/Documents/Code/agent-skills/skills/unattended-orchestration/mcp/tools/spawn.py)
- `spawn_session`: Validates arguments via JSON schema, creates branch/worktree via runner or git, generates session brief, and launches detached agent.
- `start_lane`: Initiates execution of configured lanes (`handoff.config.json`).

#### [NEW] [`lifecycle.py`](file:///c:/Users/<you>/Documents/Code/agent-skills/skills/unattended-orchestration/mcp/tools/lifecycle.py)
- `resume_session`: Resumes an existing conversation with structured recovery prompt.
- `stop_session`: Terminates a running background agent process cleanly.

#### [NEW] [`archive.py`](file:///c:/Users/<you>/Documents/Code/agent-skills/skills/unattended-orchestration/mcp/tools/archive.py)
- `archive_session`: Triggers transactional archival (`DONE.md`, logs, patch, manifest).
- `cleanup_sessions`: Idempotently purges merged branches and worktrees.

